              Rp{Math.round(comparePrice).toLocaleString('id-ID')}
            </span>
            <span class="text-[30px] sm:text-[36px] font-black text-amber-300 font-mono tracking-tight leading-none">
              Rp{Math.round(price).toLocaleString('id-ID')}
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="inline-block bg-white/10 text-amber-200 border border-amber-400/30 text-[11.5px] sm:text-[12.5px] font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg leading-tight">
              BELI 1 DAPAT 3 (Total 1.500 ml)
            </span>
            <span class="inline-block bg-amber-400 text-emerald-950 font-black text-[11px] sm:text-[11.5px] px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg uppercase tracking-wide">
              GRATIS ONGKIR
